1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:05,400
NASA Space Apps, twenty twenty-six.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,600
The challenge: find places on Earth
that analog Moon and Mars bases.

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:13,600
ROAMER scores any place on a
common five hundred metre grid,

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:17,800
shows where the analogy breaks, and
ranks sites by what nobody has studied.

5
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:21,800
Atacama passes. Pokhara fails.
Kagbeni leads.

6
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:25,000
Paste coordinates, and it finds
the nearest characterized site.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
We do not claim Earth is another planet.
We quantify how close it gets —
and what still makes it different.
